#ROOM
Vnum     50624
Name     Keshari Graduation Gallery~
Sector   city~
Desc     You completed the academy course. Proceed through the graduation gallery,
receive your diploma and continue toward the docking bay.

The gallery is a transparent orbital walkway attached to Keshari Hunter
Academy. Instead of a city beneath you, the windows reveal the muted surface
of Ross 128 b framed by the station's narrow observation ports. Structural
ribs frame the corridor while traffic lights from local shuttles move silently
beyond the glass.
~
#EXIT
