#ROOM
Vnum     50625
Name     Ross 128 b Orbital Dock~
Sector   city~
Desc     This docking bay projects from the academy station so that training shuttles
can approach without crossing the inhabited modules. Guidance lights, docking
clamps and service equipment line the perimeter.

Beyond the bay you can see the muted surface of Ross 128 b framed by the
station's narrow observation ports. A small shuttle is waiting to carry
graduates down toward Ross 128 b. To board it, use ENTER.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    50624
#ENDEXIT

